          "person": "Margarethe von Dienheim",
          "content": "waived all claims to Unterschüpf Castle, which had been sold to the von Rosenberg brothers in 1610, jointly with Hans Philipp, Georg Friedrich Eberhard, and Kunigunde Elisabeth von Dienheim, also on behalf of their brother Albrecht."
